      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm seeing some weird stuff in my greenhouse. i've got some tomato plants where the leaves have these tiny little holes in them like someone's been nibbling on the edges. i haven't seen any actual bugs during my rounds though. any idea what might be doing that?",
