    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the undersides like u said but i'm still not seeing much. just those holes and maybe some very fine dust or stuff near the stems? it's driving me crazy bc it feels like something is there and just hiding. any other possibilities for those kinds of \"hidden\" eaters?",
